# Week 1 AI Exploration Lab

## Lab Goal

The goal of this lab is to build intuition by experimenting with Generative AI tools and comparing their outputs.

## Tools Tested

1. Text Generation Tool: ChatGPT
2. Image Generation Tool: DALL·E
3. Chatbot / Assistant Tool: Claude

## Main Question

What can Generative AI do well, and where does it still have limitations?

#Create a Common Test Theme

Choose one simple theme that you will use across all 3 tools.

For example:

Theme: Generative AI for small business productivity


Other possible themes:
AI for students
AI for healthcare communication
AI for marketing content
AI for project management
AI for cybersecurity awareness
AI for personal productivity
AI for education and training

Using one theme makes it easier to compare outputs.


Write Your Prompts
Open your prompts.md file and add the prompts you will test.
Use this structure:
# Prompts Used
## Theme
Generative AI for small business productivity
---
## Prompt 1: Text Generation Prompt
Write a beginner-friendly 300-word explanation of how Generative AI can help small business owners improve productivity. Use simple language and include 3 practical examples.
---
## Prompt 2: Image Generation Prompt
Create a clean, modern image showing a small business owner using AI tools to manage emails, schedules, customer messages, and content creation. The image should feel professional, optimistic, and technology-focused. No text in the image.
---
## Prompt 3: Chatbot Prompt

I am a small business owner who wants to use Generative AI but does not know where to start. Ask me 3 questions about my business, then recommend 3 simple AI use cases I can try this week.
